{"v":4,"catch":"Don't Starve Together (饑荒聯機版) 是毫不妥協的荒野求生遊戲Don't Starve的單機多人遊戲擴展版。","desc":"走進一個充滿奇怪生物、危險和驚喜的陌生荒野世界。 收集資源來打造符合您生存風格的物品和結構。以自己的方式遊戲，揭開這片陌生土地的奧秘。\n\n在私人遊戲中與您的好友合作，或在線與陌生人一起冒險。與其他玩家一起在惡劣環境中生存，或者獨自出擊。\n\n盡一切努力，但最重要的是，Don't Starve。","publisher":"Klei Entertainment","release":"2022-11-02","genres":["冒險"],"players":"單機 1–2 人 · 網路 1–4 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","葡萄牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":4,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 6.0GB / Switch 6.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9f72a18de93f768556212c6a193bc133ed3b9672e4de9c80756ec62b9ab484e2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d90c508c9f77e0e443af1afd4537c5482e5e742ae4a7458df1db45a5bd3f030e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1e291e030aca41197fc2182cbaf04a4ce4cdada218b06caa6ec9e6c65ad0f448.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/91368788fb6aea4f08a48da76eb45f0a18dceb3cc9bdd546023ce9853c228bcc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bdaa4dd49d822adc85bf77cab915b17d48433f29869d0a11eedc1c3430c41181.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/765d7a15b407b861494eefa26f608f58375422a45d3aa649881ca52b69ab323e.jpg"],"titleId":"010090100e334000","dlc":[],"vids":["uddjS_BI2Jg"]}